==Russian==

===Alternative forms===
* {{alter|ru|тотъ||ru-PRO}}

===Etymology===
{{inh+|ru|orv|тъ|тътъ}}, reduplication of {{inh|ru|sla-pro|*tъ}}, from {{inh|ru|ine-bsl-pro|*tas}}, from {{inh|ru|ine-pro|*só}}, {{m|ine-pro|*séh₂}}, {{m|ine-pro|*tód||this, that}}. Cognate with {{cog|zlw-opl|tet}},  {{cog|lv|tas}}, {{cog|lt|tas}}, {{m|lt|ta}}, {{cog|sa|स|tr=sá}}, {{cog|sa|तत्|tr=tat}}, {{cog|ang|se}} (whence {{cog|en|the}}).

===Pronunciation===
* {{ru-IPA}}
* {{audio|ru|Ru-тот.ogg}}
* {{rhymes|ru|ot|s=1}}

===Determiner===
{{etymid|ru|determiner}}
{{head|ru|determiner|g=m|demonstrative||feminine|та|neuter|то|plural|те}}

# [[that]], [[those]] {{gl|distal to an observer}}
#: {{syn|ru|э́тот<q:partial>}}
#: {{uxi|ru|[[я|Я]] [[живу́]] [[вон]] [[там]], [[в]] '''том''' [[до́ме]].|I live over there, in '''that''' house.}}
# [[that]], [[those]] {{gl|already being talked about}}
#: {{syn|ru|э́тот<q:partial>}}
#: {{coi|ru|[[в]] '''тот''' [[день]]|on '''that''' day}}
#: {{coi|ru|[[в]] '''то''' [[вре́мя]]|at '''that''' time, at the time}}
#: {{coi|ru|[[в]] '''том''' [[сне]]|in '''that''' dream}}
# {{n-g|used to link a noun with a {{lg|relative clause}}, as in the following constructions; usually translated as "[[the]]" or, additionally in the plural, "[[those]]"}}
#: {{ux|ru|[[ты|Ты]] [[не]] '''тот''' [[челове́к]], [[в]] [[кото́рого]] [[я]] [[влюби́лась]].|You're not '''the''' person I fell in love with.}}
#: {{ux|ru|[[даже|Даже]] '''те''' [[лю́ди]], [[с]] [[кото́рыми]] [[у]] [[меня́]] [[отличный|отли́чные]] [[отноше́ния]], [[мо́гут]] [[разозли́ться]].|Even '''the''' people I have a great relationship with can get mad.}}
#: {{ux|ru|[[мы|Мы]] [[призыва́ем]] '''тех''' [[чле́нов]], [[кото́рые]] [[не]] [[согла́сны]], [[пересмотре́ть]] [[свою́]] [[пози́цию]].|We urge '''those''' members who disagree to reconsider their position.}}
# {{lb|ru|before a {{lg|relative clause}}}} the [[kind]]/[[sort]]/[[type]] of
#: {{syn|ru|тако́й<q:less common>}}
#: {{uxi|ru|[[я|Я]] '''тот''' [[челове́к]], [[кото́рый]] [[лю́бит]] [[путеше́ствовать]].|I'm '''the kind of''' person who loves to travel.}}
# {{lb|ru|in the negative}} the [[wrong]], not the [[right]]
#: {{syn|ru|неве́рный|непра́вильный}}
#: {{uxi|ru|[[я|Я]] [[набрала́]] [[не]] '''тот''' [[но́мер]].|I dialled the wrong number.}}
#: {{uxi|ru|[[это|Э́то]] [[не]] '''то''' [[ме́сто]].|That's not '''the right''' place.}}
# the [[other]], the [[opposite]], the [[distant]], the [[far]] (side etc.)
#: {{syn|ru|друго́й|противополо́жный}}
#: {{uxi|ru|[[с]] '''той''' [[стороны́]] / [[по]] '''ту''' [[сто́рону]]|on '''the other''' side}}
#: {{uxi|ru|[[на]] '''том''' [[берегу́]] [[реки́]]|across the river / on '''the other''' side of the river}}
# {{sid|ru|contrast determiner}} {{n-g|Used in certain collocations to emphasise contrast with something else.}}
#: {{coi|ru|[[тот или иной#Russian:_determiner|'''тот''' и́ли ино́й]]|some, a certain, this or that|lit='''that''' or another}}

