===Pronoun===
{{etymid|ru|pronoun}}
{{head|ru|pronoun|g=m|demonstrative||feminine|та|neuter|то|plural|те}}

# {{senseid|ru|distal pronoun}} {{lb|ru|uncommon|usually with {{m|ru|вон}}}} [[that]] one, [[those]] ones {{gl|something distal to an observer}}
#: {{syn|ru|[[вот]] [[э́тот]]|э́тот}}
#: {{uxi|ru|[[так|Так]] [[мно́го]] [[игру́шек]]... [[я|Я]] [[хочу́]] [[вон]] '''ту'''.|So many toys... I want '''that one''' over there.}}
# {{lb|ru|{{lg|definite}}|before a {{lg|relative clause}}}} {{n-g|used to refer to the instance / instances of the noun in question or just spoken about, or, with {{m|ru|кто}}, the person/people, that fall(s) into a particular category}}
## [[that]], the [[one]]; ''in the plural:'' [[those]], the [[ones]]
##: {{uxi|ru|[[методы|Ме́тод]] [[аналоги́чен]] '''тому́''', [[кото́рый]] [[описанный|опи́сан]] [[ни́же]].|The method is similar to '''that''' / '''the one''' (the method) described below.}}
##: {{uxi|ru|[[методы|Ме́тод]] [[аналоги́чен]] '''тем''', [[кото́рые]] [[описанный|опи́саны]] [[ни́же]].|The method is similar to '''those''' / '''the ones''' (the methods) described below.}}
## {{lb|ru|before {{m|ru|кто}}}} the [[person]], the [[guy]]/[[girl]]/etc.; ''in the plural:'' the [[people]] etc.
##: {{uxi|ru|[[он|Он]] '''тот''', [[кто]] [[поби́л]] [[реко́рд]].|He's '''the guy''' who broke the record.}}
##: {{uxi|ru|[[они|Они́]] '''те''', [[кому́]] [[нужна́]] [[по́мощь]].|They're '''the people''' who need help.}}
# {{lb|ru|mostly {{lg|indefinite}}|before a {{lg|relative clause}}}} {{n-g|used to refer to any instance / instances of the noun in question or just spoken about, or, with {{m|ru|кто}}, any person/people, that fall(s) into a particular category}}
## [[one]]; ''in the plural:'' [[those]], [[ones]]
##: {{syn|ru|тако́й<q:less common>}}
##: {{uxi|ru|[[лучший|Лу́чшая]] [[страте́гия]] - '''та''', [[кото́рая]] [[устро́ит]] [[всех]].|The best strategy is '''one''' that suits everyone.}}
##: {{ux|ru|[[программы|Програ́ммы]], [[кото́рые]] [[рабо́тают]], [[лу́чше]] '''тех''', [[кото́рые]] [[не]] [[рабо́тают]].|Programs that work are better than '''those''' that don't.}}
##: {{ux|ru|[[что|Что]] [[каса́ется]] [[соба́к]], [[я]] [[предпочита́ю]] '''тех''', [[кото́рые]] [[не]] [[ла́ют]] [[гро́мко]].|When it comes to dogs, I prefer '''ones''' that don't bark loudly.}}
## {{lb|ru|before {{m|ru|кто}}}} [[someone]], a [[person]], [[anyone]], [[whoever]]; ''in the plural:'' [[those]], (the/those) [[people]], [[anyone]], [[whoever]], [[some]] (people)
##: {{syn|ru|кто́-нибудь|кто́-то|лю́ди<q:plural>|тако́й<q:less common>}}
##: {{uxi|ru|[[спрошу|Спрошу́]] [[у]] '''того́''', [[кто]] [[зна́ет]].|I'll ask '''someone''' who knows.}}
##: {{ux|ru|[[хорошо|Хорошо́]], [[когда́]] [[есть]] '''тот''', [[с]] [[кем]] [[ты]] [[мо́жешь]] [[поговори́ть]] [[о]] [[свои́х]] [[пробле́мах]].|It's good when there's '''someone''' you can talk to about your problems.}}
##: {{uxi|ru|'''Тот''', [[у]] [[кого́]] [[есть]] [[де́ньги]], [[опла́тит]].|Whoever has the money will pay.}}
##: {{uxi|ru|[[это|Э́то]] [[для]] '''тех''', [[кто]] [[лю́бит]] [[ру́сский]] [[язы́к]].|This is for '''those''' who love Russian.}}
##: {{uxi|ru|[[есть|Есть]] '''те''', [[кто]] [[дума́ет]], [[что]] [[мы]] [[сдади́мся]].|There are '''some (people)''' who think we'll give up.}}
# {{lb|ru|{{lg|indefinite}}|before a {{lg|relative clause}}}} {{n-g|used to refer to the kind/sort/type of the noun in question or just spoken about, or, with {{m|ru|кто}}, person/people, described in the following clause}}
## the [[kind]]/[[sort]]/[[type]] (of [noun]), the [[kind]]s/[[sort]]s/[[type]]s (of [noun in plural])
##: {{syn|ru|тако́й<q:less common>}}
##: {{uxi|ru|[[этот|Э́тот]] [[лёд]] [[не]] '''тот''', [[что]] [[мы]] [[де́лаем]] [[у]] [[себя́]] [[в]] [[холоди́льнике]].|This ice is not '''the kind (of ice)''' we make at home in the fridge.}}
## {{lb|ru|before {{m|ru|кто}}|can also be pluralised and placed after {{m|ru|из}} in the {{lg|genitive case}}}} the [[kind]]/[[sort]]/[[type]] of [[person]]/[[people]], the [[type]] (to), [[one]](s) (to)
##: {{syn|ru|кто́-то<q:uncommon>|лю́ди<q:plural>|тако́й<q:less common>}}
##: {{uxi|ru|[[он|Он]] [[не]] '''тот''', [[кто]] [[жа́луется]].|He's not '''the kind of person''' to complain.}}
##: {{uxi|ru|[[он|Они́]] [[не]] '''те''', [[кто]] [[жа́луется]].|They're not '''the type of people''' to complain.}}
##: {{uxi|ru|[[он|Он]] [[не]] [[из]] '''тех''', [[кто]] [[жа́луется]].|He's not the kind of person to complain.}}
# {{lb|ru|in the masculine singular}} {{n-g|Optionally used in the following construction to refer to the person denoted by {{m|ru|кто}} earlier in the sentence. Can be omitted, and in English usually the sentence is translated without it too. Has the meaning "that [[person]]".}}
#: {{uxi|ru|[[кто|Кто]] [[не]] [[трус]], ('''тот''') [[продо́лжит]].|He who is not a coward will continue.|lit=Who is not a coward, ('''that person''') will continue.}}
#: {{uxi|ru|[[у|У]] [[кого́]] [[есть]] [[де́ньги]], ('''тот''' [[и]]) [[опла́тит]].|Whoever has the money will pay.}}
# {{lb|ru|masculine only}} {{n-g|Used to refer to the last-mentioned person in a sentence; usually simply translated with the relevant pronoun or the person's name/role. Has the meaning "the [[latter]]".}}
#: {{ux|ru|[[репортёр|Репортёр]] [[за́дал]] [[Джеймс|Дже́ймсу]] [[вопро́с]], [[а]] '''тот''' [[не]] [[отвеча́л]].|The reporter asked James a question, but '''he (James)''' didn't answer.}}
#: {{ux|ru|[[он|Он]] [[помо́г]] [[дру́гу]], [[за]] [[что]] '''тот''' [[был]] [[ему́]] [[благода́рен]].|He helped his friend, for which '''his friend''' was grateful to him.}}
# {{sid|ru|contrast pronoun}} {{n-g|Used in certain collocations to emphasise contrast with something else.}}
#: {{coi|ru|[[тот или иной#Russian:_pronoun|'''тот''' и́ли ино́й]]|a certain one, this or that one, whatever one|lit='''that one''' or another}}
# {{lb|ru|in the negative}} the [[wrong]] one, not the [[right]] one, [[wrong]]
#: {{syn|ru|неве́рный|непра́вильный}}
#: {{uxi|ru|[[номер|Но́мер]] [[не]] '''тот'''.|The number is '''wrong'''.}}

====Usage notes====
* See {{m|ru|то|id=pronoun}} for additional pronoun senses specific to the neuter singular.
* {{m-self|ru|тот|Тот}} in [[#Russian:_distal_pronoun|the first pronoun sense]] is used much less commonly than {{m|ru|э́тот|id=overlap}}.
* Even when used in the plural, if {{m|ru|кто}} follows, the remaining clause is in the singular: {{m|ru|'''те''' (plural), [[кто]] [[лю́бит]] (singular)|tr=te, kto ljúbit|t=those (plural) who love (singular)}}.
* When {{m|ru|кто}} is used after {{m-self|ru|тот}}, {{m-self|ru|тот}} is implied to mean a person or people: {{m|ru|'''те''', [[кто]] [[лю́бит]] [[сноубо́рдинг]]|t=those (people) who love snowboarding}}. {{m|ru|который|Кото́рый}} is used after {{m-self|ru|тот}} when {{m-self|ru|тот}} refers to a particular noun that has been mentioned (which could still be a category of people, or even the word "people", {{m|ru|лю́ди}}): {{m|ru|[[не]] [[все]] [[чле́ны]], [[а]] [[то́лько]] '''те''', [[кото́рые]] [[получи́ли]] [[разреше́ние]]|t=not all members (a particular noun), only those (of that noun) who received permission}}. {{m|ru|что|Что}} after {{m-self|ru|тот}} can also be used in either case but may be seen as archaic or colloquial.

